"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2711,"###
 Narrated to us by Isa ibn Ibrahim, who said: Ibn Wahb informed us, stating: Yunus ibn Yazid and Amr ibn al-Harith informed me from Ibn Shihab, from Salim, from his father, who said: Umar ibn al-Khattab (RA) kissed the Black Stone, and said, ""By Allah, I know that you are merely a stone. If I had not seen the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) kissing you, I would not have kissed you."" Amr said: Zay"
